  "details": "Switching from Virtual desktop to Quest version of VRChat does not log out player automatically\nRepro steps: Join a friends/public world, without logging out of VRChat switch to the Quest version/a new instance of the game, when you've loaded in join the same world your original instance is in\nExpected: log out of any previous instances automatically\nActual: I can see a copy of myself in the world and I take up 2 slots.\nPC Version: VRChat 2022.2.2p3 Live Beta\nQuest Version: 2022.2.2p2c",
